bid:20adc9fb-c389-48a7-85ec-931501f0ce13 a bbqs:FundingOpportunity ;
    bbqs:description "Supports cutting-edge mathematics and basic science research that uses Empire AI's multinode GPU clusters and foundational machine learning models, in computational astrophysics, physics, biology, mathematics, neuroscience, or computational physical chemistry. Up to $6M total over two years (2027-06-01 to 2029-05-31), 6-12 awards. PI must be tenure-track/tenured at an Empire AI member institution (Columbia, Cornell, CUNY, SUNY, RPI, NYU, Rochester, RIT, Icahn/Mount Sinai); additional PIs may join by subcontract from outside institutions." ;
    bbqs:external_url "https://www.simonsfoundation.org/grant/utilizing-the-full-power-of-empire-ai-request-for-applications/" ;
    bbqs:name "Utilizing the Full Power of Empire AI — Request for Applications (Simons Foundation)" .

