bid:72c84eee-67e0-47db-9502-bb55558d9819 a bbqs:Dataset ;
    bbqs:description "This project contains synthetic data files which demonstrate the use of and support development of the NDX Wearables extension. Neurodata without borders (NWB), with its supporting suite of tools and online data archives, offers a promising medium for data sharing, but does not support wearables data. We describe and implement an NWB extension package that enables NWB to support a wide variety of data modalities recorded from wearable devices and handle multiple concurrent estimates of the same metric from multiple independent devices. This package, along with support from data sharing platforms, will enable better collaborations, more reproducible analysis, and the development of better foundational models of disorders. You will find the up to date v0.2 example in 'sub-synthetic-pre-release-0-2'." ;
    bbqs:external_url "https://dandi.emberarchive.org/dandiset/000207" ;
    bbqs:name "NDX Wearables" .

