bid:93329bb6-37be-42e7-ab57-1fd03dde223b a bbqs:Dataset ;
    bbqs:description "This data contains synchronized respiration and behavioral data collected from male C57 mice during resident–intruder social-interaction sessions, including BLRI, RI1, and RI2 conditions. Data are represented in Neurodata Without Borders (NWB) format and include respiration time series, synchronized behavioral video, manual BORIS behavioral annotations, SLEAP pose-estimation coordinates, and associated SLEAP confidence scores. Video, respiration, behavioral annotations, and pose-estimation data are aligned using the shared Trodes acquisition clock. ECG data are not included." ;
    bbqs:external_url "https://dandi.emberarchive.org/dandiset/000534" ;
    bbqs:name "Respiratory dynamics during resident–intruder social interactions in male mice" .

